{
  "slug": "ear-flap-beanie",
  "title": "Ear-flap beanie",
  "subtitle": "A warm beanie with knitted ear flaps and i-cord ties.",
  "excerpt": "A bottom-up aran beanie worked in the round with two ear flaps knitted separately and incorporated into the cast-on. The flaps cover the ears and tie under the chin with i-cord strings. Fits adult heads 54 to 61 cm.",
